se2","lase3","lase4","lase5","mass2","mass3","mass4","mass5","miss2","miss3","miss4","miss5"],"names":{"Root.Owner.GetName":{"zh":"我们的帝国","en":"our empire"}}},{"id":"anomaly.257","kind":"event","title":{"zh":"残酷的发现","en":"A Brutal Find"},"texts":[{"zh":"科学专员[Root.GetLeaderName]认为幸存者们隐藏武器的决定十分正确。在地底洞穴中找到的这些武器虽然与[Root.Owner.GetName]的现役装备原理相同，但更为先进。这些科技一定会对[Root.Owner.GetSpeciesAdj]战争机器大有帮助。","en":"Science Officer [Root.GetLeaderName] remarks that the previous inhabitants of this place were right to hide these weapons, recovered from a cave beneath the ruins, away. They build on the same basic principles as weapons already in use in the [Root.Owner.GetName], but are far more advanced. These technologies are sure to be a boon to the [Root.Owner.GetSpeciesAdj] military machine."}],"sections":[],"image":"art/6b820a05f6f9571130a4.webp","hidden":false,"choices":[{"key":"anomaly.257.a","label":{"zh":"什么？我们已经有这些科技了。","en":"What? We already possess this technology."},"responses":[],"tooltips":[],"conditional":true,"next":[],"terminal":false,"when":[[{"type":"other","key":"has_technology","arg":"tech_energy_lance_1","scope":"owner","value":true,"label":{"zh":"粒子光矛","en":"Particle Lances"}},{"type":"other","key":"has_technology","arg":"tech_kinetic_artillery_1","scope":"owner","value":true,"label":{"zh":"动能火炮","en":"Kinetic Battery"}},{"type":"other","key":"has_technology","arg":"tech_swarmer_missiles_1","scope":"owner","value":true,"label":{"zh":"蜂群导弹","en":"Swarmer Missiles"}}]]},{"key":"anomaly.257.b","label":{"zh":"升级我们的激光武器。","en":"Upgrade our laser weapons."},"responses":[],"tooltips":[],"conditional":true,"next":[],"terminal":false,"when":[[{"type":"other","key":"has_technology","arg":"tech_energy_lance_1","scope":"owner","value":false,"label":{"zh":"粒子光矛","en":"Particle Lances"}}]]},{"key":"anomaly.257.c","label":{"zh":"升级我们的质量投射器。","en":"Upgrade our mass drivers."},"responses":[],"tooltips":[],"conditional":true,"next":[],"terminal":false,"when":[[{"type":"other","key":"has_technology","arg":"tech_kinetic_artillery_1","scope":"owner","value":false,"label":{"zh":"动能火炮","en":"Kinetic Battery"}}]]},{"key":"anomaly.257.d","label":{"zh":"升级我们的导弹。","en":"Upgrade our missiles."},"responses":[],"tooltips":[],"conditional":true,"next":[],"terminal":false,"when":[[{"type":"other","key":"has_technology","arg":"tech_swarmer_missiles_1","scope":"owner","value":false,"label":{"zh":"蜂群导弹","en":"Swarmer Missiles"}}]]}],"next":[],"source":{"file":"events/anomaly_events_1.txt","line":3612},"names":{"Root.Owner.GetName":{"zh":"我们的帝国","en":"our empire"},"Root.GetLeaderName":{"zh":"这位领袖","en":"the leader"},"Root.Owner.GetSpeciesAdj":{"zh":"该族","en":"the species'"}}}],"summary":{"text":"# 行星伤痕 / Planetary Scars\n\n- 分类 Category：深空异闻 Exploration (C3)\n- 来源 Sources：`common/anomalies/01_anomaly_categories.txt:734-751` · `events/anomaly_events_1.txt` · `common/special_projects/`\n- 审阅 Review：2026-10-13（c3b-exploration）· 已审阅 Reviewed\n\n## 如何开始 How it starts\n\n- 4级异常，权重3；大陆/热带/苔原行星。  \n  Level-4 anomaly, weight 3; continental/tropical/tundra planets.\n\n## 剧情脉络 Story outline\n\n- 单一结局255“往昔的末日”（研究）：b→ULTIMATE_WEAPON_PROJECT→随机：50%258空手/40%256有趣发现（多个武器科技选项）/10%257残酷发现（升级激光/质量/导弹）。  \n  Single outcome 255 (research): b → ULTIMATE_WEAPON_PROJECT → random: 50% 258 empty-handed / 40% 256 interesting find / 10% 257 brutal find (upgrade lasers/mass drivers/missiles).\n\n## 分支与结局 Branches and outcomes\n\n- 结局互斥，a选项不开启项目。  \n  Outcomes are exclusive; option a starts no project.\n\n## 条件与文明差异 Conditions and variants\n\n- 256、257的选项随已有武器科技变化。  \n  Options in 256/257 vary with known weapon technologies.\n\n## 审阅记录 Review notes\n\n- 已对照类别脚本734-751与树。  \n  Compared category script 734-751 and the tree.\n- 覆盖 Coverage：全部6个文档。 / All 6 docs.\n","path":"summaries/anomaly-cont-signs-cat.md"}}